        "{{ModID}}_GusSyrup": "ItemDelivery/Heart Melon Syrup wanted!/Gus needs Heart Melon Syrup for a pastry he wants to make./Bring Gus 4 bottles of Heart melon Syrup./Gus (O){{ModID}}_HeartMelonSyrup 4/0/5000/-1/true/Oh! Would you look at that! It's the syrup I asked for. Thank you, @.",
        },
    },

    { 
    "LogName": "Trigger Action: add Syrup quest mail",
